# 24. ESCROW SYSTEM

Create a mock escrow ledger.

Booking financial states:

```text
UNPAID
HELD_IN_ESCROW
PARTIALLY_RELEASED
RELEASED
REFUNDED
DISPUTED
```

When customer completes mock payment:

Money becomes:

```text
HELD_IN_ESCROW
```

not immediately paid to provider.

Provider dashboard displays:

```text
Escrow Pending
```

After successful completion handshake:

```text
RELEASED
```

Provider dashboard then displays:

```text
Released Earnings
```

Create transaction records rather than merely changing one number.

